      "side": 1,
      "message": "As I reduce the sleep interval here, app performance slows down visibly(even in perf mode) possibly due to a larger number of memory accesses having to go through the fault handler as well as CPU load spikes. The 5us sleep allows Youtube to play a video and simultaneously scroll through videos without visible jank and allows the data to be gathered for a few hours. We might be able to reduce it slightly if needed.",
